WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:04.733
Hi! Let's do some exercise together. Stand up!

2
00:00:06.183 --> 00:00:10.549
Put your arms up. Stretch your arms and your fingers!

3
00:00:12.799 --> 00:00:18.743
Now, move your shoulders slowly. And move your neck to the left and to the right.

4
00:00:20.993 --> 00:00:24.383
Look at your feet. Now move your toes!

5
00:00:26.633 --> 00:00:30.673
Bend your knees a little and touch the floor with your hands.

6
00:00:32.923 --> 00:00:37.474
Now sit down. Close your eyes and breathe through your nose.

7
00:00:37.924 --> 00:00:42.847
Very good! Head, shoulders, knees and toes!

